== Behavior ==
Viles will [[Creature AI#When avoiding fire|avoid fire]], they will run away if they get within 3 meters of a fire source. They will still attack players holding a [[Torch]], but they will alter the attack direction at the last moment, making many attacks miss.

Viles consume [[Blueberries]] on the ground, but they are not [[tameable]]. They do not attack [[Bear]]s despite being in two different enemy [[factions]].

== Attacks and abilities ==
The Vile shares all of its animations with the [[Bear]].

=== Bite ===
Lunges forward to bite the player (20 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 130 [[Damage types#Pierce|Pierce]] damage). This extends 4 meters in a 45-degree horizontal arc and can be used every 4 seconds when within 3 meters of a player.

=== Claws ===
Stands on their hind legs, bounces forward a little, and slams down to attack (130 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 40 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] damage). This attack has an arched hitbox 5.5 meters long and 45 degrees across horizontally. It can be used every 4 seconds when within 5 meters of a player.

=== Swipe ===
This attack has two variations, each with its own 4-second cooldown: a swipe with the left claw and a swipe with the right claw (120 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 40 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] damage). This attack extends 5.5 meters out in a 45-degree horizontal arc and can be used within 5 meters of a player.

=== Swipe combo ===
Chains both the left swipe and the right swipe together (60 [[Damage types#Slash|Slash]] and 40 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] damage each hit). This attack extends 5.5 meters out in a 45-degree horizontal arc and can be used within 5 meters of a player.

=== Slam ===
Looks very similar to the claw attack, but remains stationary instead of bouncing forward and puts slightly more emphasis on their paws instead of claws (150 [[Damage types#Blunt|Blunt]], 40 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Chop|Chop]] and 40 Tier 0 [[Damage types#Pickaxe|Pickaxe]] damage). Unlike the claw attack, this attack hits in a circular area with a radius of 2.5 meters. This can be used every 12 seconds when within 5 meters of a player.

